{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51326","headline":"晚次渭上 · 冷朝阳","name":"晚次渭上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚来清渭上，一似楚江边。\n鱼网依沙岸，人家旁水田。\n不逢京口信，空认渡头船。\n逆旅无消息，归心谁爲传？\n（《又玄集》上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冷朝阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}